      "id": "PS01",
      "title": "FLUX.2 prompting",
      "url": "https://docs.bfl.ai/guides/prompting_guide_flux2",
      "summary": "官方FLUX.2 pro/max文档提供自然语言构图、镜头和文字描述建议，并注明无负面提示支持；不能泛化为本地Klein或其他模型已实测。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS02",
      "title": "Diffusers SDXL",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/docs/diffusers/main/using-diffusers/sdxl",
      "summary": "官方说明SDXL双文本编码器与独立条件输入；负面条件是否生效要看实际guidance和节点。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS03",
      "title": "Qwen Image Edit",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit",
      "summary": "模型卡展示参考图编辑与文字编辑能力；能力声明不等于商品细节或每个字符必然正确。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS04",
      "title": "IC-Light",
      "url": "https://github.com/lllyasviel/IC-Light",
      "summary": "上游区分前景文本条件和背景条件重打光，并说明Lighting Preference属于初始latent控制；单靠描述不是已接入重打光。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS05",
      "title": "IP-Adapter",
      "url": "https://github.com/tencent-ailab/IP-Adapter",
      "summary": "上游展示图像与文本条件结合；图像裁切可能丢边缘，适配器类别与权重需匹配，文字不替代身份条件。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS06",
      "title": "ControlNet",
      "url": "https://github.com/lllyasviel/ControlNet",
      "summary": "上游列出边缘、深度与姿态等结构条件；姿势与几何约束需要实际控制图和匹配模型，不靠提示词自动启用。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS07",
      "title": "ComfyUI examples",
      "url": "https://comfyanonymous.github.io/ComfyUI_examples/",
      "summary": "官方示例图片含工作流元数据；真正工作流与独立提示词资料JSON不同。原Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_examples猜测URL404，已换有效入口。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS08",
      "title": "Adobe product photography",
      "url": "https://www.adobe.com/creativecloud/photography/type/product-photography.html",
      "summary": "产品摄影教程强调受控光线和拍摄实践；我们将其用于场景检查，不搬用为生成模型参数保证。",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-02",
      "evidence": "read-primary-source-not-runtime-test"
    },
    {
      "id": "PS09",
      "title": "Canon macro focus",
